{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52620","headline":"古镜 · 沈佺期","name":"古镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凿井遘古坟，古坟衬沦没。\n谁家青铜镜，送此长波月。\n长河何冥冥，千岁光不彻。\n玉匣历穷泉，金龙潜幽窟。\n鞶组已销散，锦衣亦亏阙。\n莓苔翳清池，虾蟆蚀明月。\n埋落今如此，照心未当歇。\n愿垂拂拭恩，爲君监云发。\n（见斯二七一七《珠英学士集》残卷，据吴企明先生录本〖未刊〗。\n《全唐诗》卷九五仅存末六句，今补全重录。\n残卷原缺题，今从《全唐诗》补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}